//
// All matched-filter reference waveforms used by the correlator.
// Edit ONLY this file when adding, removing, or replacing templates.
//
// TEMPLATE_LEN   — number of complex samples in each template row.
//                  ALL rows must have exactly this length.  Update it
//                  whenever you change the upsampling factor or the
//                  pulse duration so that 2*TEMPLATE_LEN matches the
//                  number of floats in each row below.
//
// prnTemplateTable — 2-D array of interleaved I/Q float32 samples.
//                  Each row is one reference waveform at the bladeRF
//                  sample rate, pulse-shaped and upsampled exactly as
//                  the transmitter generates it.  Add a new row for
//                  each additional code to search.
//
// numCodesInTable — derived automatically from prnTemplateTable;
//                  do not set it manually.
//
// Format reminder: { I0, Q0, I1, Q1, ... }  — 2 floats per sample.
// Real-only (BPSK) templates: set every Q sample to 0.0f.

